   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-year PSD Toolkit programme, from 1 January 2019 to 31 December 2023 (5 years)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PSD Toolkit programme was set up in late 2013 (then under the name &#x2018;PSD apps&#x2019;) as a flexible toolkit capable of responding quickly to queries from embassies and consulates regarding private sector development. The programme has functioned since 2014 to the great satisfaction of users, the recent Mid-term review (MTR) also showed, and meets the objectives of MFA Sustainable Economic Development Department (DDE). Hence, the programme will also be continued in (slightly modified form).</narrative>
  </description>
